  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed first floor rear extension by reason of siting, design and its close proximity to the existing rear dormer, in conjunction with the existing gable end would result in a contrived roof form that would appear unsympathetic, incongruous, obtrusive, and to the detriment of the character and visual appearance of the host dwelling and the immediate locality. The proposal would therefore be contrary to the high-quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2026), Policies D3 and D4 of the London Plan (2021), Policy GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021 – 2041), and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
